      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعَنٌّ</span></b>  One <i>who enters into that which does not
concern him, and interferes in everything;</i> (K;)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرِّيضٌ</span>, (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِّيضٌ مِتْيَحٌ</span>: (TA: [see
these two words:]) fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<i>An orator,</i> or <i>a preacher;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطِيبٌ</span>: (S, K:)
or <i>an eloquent</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خطيب</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also the
